sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant SC as SecurityConfig
    participant F as JwtAuthFilter
    participant P as UserAuthenticationProvider
    participant SEC as SecurityContextHolder
    participant CTRL as Controller
    participant EP as UserAuthenticationEntryPoint
    participant OAUTH as OAuth2 Login (Spring)

    Note over SC: SecurityConfig sets up the filter chain<br>and adds JwtAuthFilter before BasicAuthenticationFilter
    
    C->>F: HTTP Request with Authorization: Bearer <token>
    alt Valid JWT Present
        F->>P: validateToken(token) / validateTokenStrongly(token)
        P-->>F: Authentication Object
        F->>SEC: Set Authentication in Security Context
        F-->>SC: Continue Filter Chain
        SC-->>CTRL: Forward request to Controller
        CTRL-->>C: HTTP 200 OK (Success Response)
    else Missing/Invalid JWT
        F->>SEC: Clear Security Context
        F-->>EP: Trigger Authentication Entry Point
        EP-->>C: HTTP 401 Unauthorized (JSON error)
    end

    Note over SC,OAUTH: Optional OAuth2 login flow (configured in SecurityConfig)
    C->>OAUTH: OAuth2 Login Request
    OAUTH-->>C: Redirects to /oauth2/success or /oauth2/error